{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26761","headline":"罢武功县将入城 一 · 姚合","name":"罢武功县将入城 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乍抛衫笏觉身轻，依旧还称学道名。\n欲泥山僧分屋住，羞从野老借牛耕。\n妻儿尽怕爲逋客，亲故相邀遣到城。\n无奈同官珍重意，几回临路却休行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26761.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26761","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}